l":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\r\n\r\n- Reproducible in 4.4-dev4\r\n- Not reproducible in 4.4-dev3\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nGodot v4.4.dev4 - macOS 15.1.0 - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon Pro 5500 XT OpenGL Engine - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10700K CPU @ 3.80GHz (16 threads)(TM) i7-10700K CPU @ 3.80GHz (16 threads)\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nWith multiple Buttons stacked vertically on top of each other, pressing up or down on the PS5 DualSense controller frequently does not register as moving the Control focus between them.\r\n\r\nShort video of the behavior on an MRP in 4.4-dev4:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87735a8f-542f-4f0d-a6d7-477384b99339\r\n\r\n\r\nFor comparison, the same MRP in 4.4-dev3:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09171831-be97-4f29-9038-0d2c60ffb5f1\r\n\r\nTested on macOS Sequoia 15.1 (and behavior observed) with:\r\n- PlayStation 5 DualSense controller, wired\r\n- Nintendo Switch Pro Controller, wired\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nWith a controller connected, open and run the MRP. \"Button 1\" will be focused by default. Press up and down on the controller's left stick to move the focused button. On 4.4-dev3, the focused button should change every time you move the stick; on 4.4-dev4, it will often take several flicks to get the focused button to change.\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\n[controller-not-working.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17686059/controller-not-working.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98982/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98982/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}